# Chat with your PDF

An AI-powered web app that lets you upload any PDF and ask questions about it in plain language.
Every answer shows the page numbers it came from.

🔗 **Live app:** https://pdf-chat-ai-7xmmn3plmwakm3k8bywt7c.streamlit.app/

## Features
- **Smart search (RAG):** finds the most relevant parts of the PDF before answering
- **Page sources:** every answer shows which pages it used
- **Live streaming answers:** words appear as the AI writes them
- **Responsive design:** works on mobile and desktop
- **Error handling:** detects scanned, broken, password-protected, or oversized PDFs
- **Privacy-friendly:** files are processed in memory and never stored

## How It Works

1. **Read:** extracts text from each page of the PDF
2. **Split:** cuts the text into small overlapping chunks
3. **Embed:** turns each chunk into numbers (embeddings) that capture its meaning
4. **Search:** finds the chunks most similar to the question (cosine similarity)
5. **Answer:** sends only the best chunks to Gemini, which writes the answer with page sources

## Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Main language |
| Streamlit | Web interface |
| Google Gemini API | AI answers + embeddings |
| pypdf | Reading PDF text |
| NumPy | Similarity search |

##  Project Structure

```
├── .streamlit/
│   └── config.toml      # Theme colors
├── app.py               # Main app code
├── requirements.txt     # Libraries needed
└── README.md
```

##  Run Locally

1. **Clone the repo**
```bash
   git clone https://github.com/Amycodes2025/pdf-chat-ai.git
   cd pdf-chat-ai
```

2. **Create and activate a virtual environment**
```bash
   python -m venv venv
   venv\Scripts\activate
```

3. **Install libraries**
```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
```

4. **Add Gemini API key**
   Create `.streamlit/secrets.toml`:
```toml
   GEMINI_API_KEY = "api-key-here"
```
   Get a free key at [Google AI Studio](https://aistudio.google.com).

5. **Run the app**
```bash
   streamlit run app.py
```

##  Limits & Privacy

- Max file size: **10 MB**, max **100 pages**
- Scanned PDFs (images only) are not supported yet
- Uses the Gemini free tier, so please **don't upload private or sensitive files**
- Cached data is auto-deleted after 1 hour

##  Future Improvements

- Support for multiple PDFs at once
- OCR for scanned PDFs
- Export chat history
- Option for a fully local AI model for private documents

